1
00:01:32,710 --> 00:01:35,009
[Forging Justice]

2
00:01:35,270 --> 00:01:37,670
[Episode 9]

3
00:01:42,590 --> 00:01:44,280
Thank you, professors, for still

4
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,840
considering me an old school mate.

5
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:46,900
Oh, hear yourself.

6
00:01:47,070 --> 00:01:48,280
Cheng was the tallest

7
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:49,759
in his department back then,

8
00:01:49,759 --> 00:01:50,560
so I remember him best.

9
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,640
Right.

10
00:01:51,660 --> 00:01:52,350
Zhou,

11
00:01:52,759 --> 00:01:53,950
you were the famous

12
00:01:54,100 --> 00:01:55,900
on-site interpreter on campus.

13
00:01:56,759 --> 00:01:58,310
But once during a foreign expert's visit,

14
00:01:58,310 --> 00:01:59,570
I made a fool of myself.

15
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,230
I still remember

16
00:02:01,430 --> 00:02:02,730
that some boys in our department

17
00:02:02,730 --> 00:02:03,930
and yours dug a celler

18
00:02:03,950 --> 00:02:05,280
for the school canteen.

19
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:05,950
Exactly.

20
00:02:05,950 --> 00:02:07,510
There was even a competition.

21
00:02:07,510 --> 00:02:08,750
In the winter of 1955,

22
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,080
Wang Dongping sneaked

23
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,940
into the cellar to steal radishes

24
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,020
and passed out due to lack of oxygen.

25
00:02:13,020 --> 00:02:13,910
A life almost perished.

26
00:02:13,910 --> 00:02:14,840
Drop that topic.

27
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,070
Now, Wang Dongping has become

28
00:02:16,070 --> 00:02:17,910
the Chief Prosecutor
of the provincial procuratorate.

29
00:02:17,910 --> 00:02:18,770
How time flies.

30
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,240
Well, Qin,

31
00:02:23,030 --> 00:02:25,150
are you being affected by some sort

32
00:02:25,870 --> 00:02:28,310
of unresolved issues regarding your past?

33
00:02:32,310 --> 00:02:35,370
For instance, a policy
that hasn't been applied to you?

34
00:02:38,710 --> 00:02:39,750
You hooligan!

35
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,440
Despicable cheater!

36
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,200
I'd rather not say it.

37
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,320
The fault is all mine.

38
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,680
I-In these past two days,

39
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,380
I feel like

40
00:02:59,079 --> 00:03:00,280
I'm living in a dream.

41
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,420
I've never been

42
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:05,750
this happy and liberated

43
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,240
over these years.

44
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,310
I believe

45
00:03:10,870 --> 00:03:12,080
in another world,

46
00:03:12,990 --> 00:03:14,360
there is a Qin Zhigao

47
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:17,220
who didn't take the wrong path

48
00:03:18,079 --> 00:03:19,140
and has also become

49
00:03:20,590 --> 00:03:21,710
a Chief Prosecutor,

50
00:03:21,710 --> 00:03:22,770
a presiding judge,

51
00:03:23,750 --> 00:03:25,150
or a renowned professor.

52
00:03:26,530 --> 00:03:27,730
I truly believe that.

53
00:03:34,030 --> 00:03:34,840
So do we.

54
00:03:43,650 --> 00:03:44,180
Oh right.

55
00:03:44,470 --> 00:03:44,930
Zhigao,

56
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,460
we have a surprise for you,

57
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:48,520
don't we?

58
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:50,800
Well, tomorrow morning,

59
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,220
let's go meet someone.

60
00:04:00,010 --> 00:04:00,560
Yizhong,

61
00:04:00,590 --> 00:04:02,430
did you sleep beside the loo?

62
00:04:02,870 --> 00:04:04,330
Yes, in the first two days.

63
00:04:04,630 --> 00:04:06,400
Then, as my status went up,

64
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,140
they got me a soft sleeper.

65
00:04:08,630 --> 00:04:09,150
Why?

66
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:13,600
They asked me to be their legal advisor.

67
00:04:14,310 --> 00:04:15,590
The inmates know little about the law.

68
00:04:15,590 --> 00:04:16,510
Many of them can't even spell

69
00:04:16,510 --> 00:04:17,570
the word "lawyer."

70
00:04:17,870 --> 00:04:19,329
So they all buttered me up.

71
00:04:19,390 --> 00:04:20,120
Good for you.

72
00:04:20,810 --> 00:04:22,720
Officers usually deliver legal services
to the grassroots.

73
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:23,720
But you offer them right from

74
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,380
beside the inmates' pillows.

75
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,290
Zhang Lihui,

76
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:30,040
did you send the telegram
that asked my mother

77
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:30,860
to come over?

78
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:32,920
Yes.

79
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,040
And no, in a sense.

80
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:38,290
You're an even worse liar than I am.

81
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,990
I did send that telegram.

82
00:04:41,310 --> 00:04:42,000
Before your mother came,

83
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,480
I talked to her on the phone.

84
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:45,360
But the idea wasn't mine.

85
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:47,950
I thought you just came up

86
00:04:47,950 --> 00:04:49,280
with an evil idea again.

87
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:51,480
There's actually a mastermind behind it.

88
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,390
Who is it?

89
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:59,360
J-Just think of it as my doing.

90
00:04:59,510 --> 00:05:00,370
Blame me for it.

91
00:05:14,270 --> 00:05:14,870
Yuan,

92
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:16,560
Berman's work,

93
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,950
Law and Revolution,

94
00:05:17,950 --> 00:05:19,270
was brought from Harvard

95
00:05:19,270 --> 00:05:20,270
by someone I asked.

96
00:05:20,270 --> 00:05:20,830
I know.

97
00:05:21,770 --> 00:05:23,630
It didn't stay in my hands for long

98
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:24,430
before I lent it to you.

99
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:24,830
Right.

100
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,160
It's been quite some time.

101
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:27,390
Are you going to return

102
00:05:27,390 --> 00:05:28,590
that book to me or not?

103
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,600
I already did.

104
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,240
When?

105
00:05:31,260 --> 00:05:32,430
I had Ma mailed it.

106
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:33,630
What?

107
00:05:33,630 --> 00:05:34,190
The book.

108
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:35,870
You had me mailed tea leaves, didn't you?

109
00:05:35,870 --> 00:05:36,310
Yes.

110
00:05:36,310 --> 00:05:37,270
What tea leaves?

111
00:05:37,630 --> 00:05:38,630
There was also a book

112
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:40,440
with a blue cover and gold lettering.

113
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:41,480
Did you lose it on the way?

114
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:43,040
No. You only told me to mail tea leaves.

115
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:43,870
Where is the book then?

116
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:44,530
The book...

117
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:45,600
The book is...

118
00:05:46,390 --> 00:05:48,040
Look, you have it, don't you?

119
00:05:48,070 --> 00:05:48,470
You...

120
00:05:48,750 --> 00:05:50,680
Wait, Yuan, isn't this

121
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,800
blatant robbery?

122
00:05:53,190 --> 00:05:54,480
Grant me an extension.

123
00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:54,830
You...

124
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:55,430
Cheng, I'm

125
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,480
not done with it yet.

126
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:56,830
Y-You...

127
00:05:56,830 --> 00:05:57,159
Just a few more days.

128
00:05:57,159 --> 00:05:58,270
I demand 5 boxes of tea leaves.

129
00:05:58,270 --> 00:05:58,700
Five boxes.

130
00:05:58,700 --> 00:05:59,430
Yuan Yifang!

131
00:05:59,750 --> 00:06:00,430
Oh, you...

132
00:06:00,750 --> 00:06:02,200
I heard your voice from afar.

133
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:02,690
Are you

134
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:03,830
bullying Cheng again?

135
00:06:03,830 --> 00:06:04,750
He's the one bullying me.

136
00:06:04,750 --> 00:06:05,380
Did you not hear he just

137
00:06:05,380 --> 00:06:07,510
blackmailed me for 5 boxes of tea leaves?

138
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:08,110
Professor Yuan, hello.

139
00:06:08,110 --> 00:06:09,190
My name is Yu Gaoyuan.

140
00:06:09,190 --> 00:06:10,160
I've attended your lectures.

141
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,160
I admire you a lot.

142
00:06:11,510 --> 00:06:11,910
Hello.

143
00:06:12,430 --> 00:06:13,160
Mr. Yuan, nice to...

144
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:13,720
Mr. Yuan!

145
00:06:14,510 --> 00:06:15,040
Mr. Yuan,

146
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:17,360
I'm Qin Zhigao from the Class of '53,

147
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,430
and also the defense counsel

148
00:06:19,630 --> 00:06:20,600
for Li Xiang's case.

149
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,000
Such an honor to meet you.

150
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:22,970
Oh, right, you see...

151
00:06:22,970 --> 00:06:23,630
Alright, good.

152
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:24,870
No need for introductions then.

153
00:06:24,870 --> 00:06:26,070
Everyone in this room

154
00:06:26,070 --> 00:06:27,270
knows about you.

155
00:06:27,270 --> 00:06:28,510
Yes, of course we do.

156
00:06:28,940 --> 00:06:29,680
Who doesn't know

157
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:30,560
that Mr. Yuan Yifang

158
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:32,390
is the most famous lawyer in China?

159
00:06:32,390 --> 00:06:32,950
The most

160
00:06:32,950 --> 00:06:34,510
failed one too, I'm telling you.

161
00:06:34,510 --> 00:06:34,909
Right.

162
00:06:35,020 --> 00:06:35,720
But the thing is,

163
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:37,050
the more cases he loses,

164
00:06:37,310 --> 00:06:38,909
the more clients come to him.

165
00:06:39,070 --> 00:06:39,360
See?

166
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:39,830
How very odd.

167
00:06:39,830 --> 00:06:40,830
Hey, Yuan, t-tell

168
00:06:40,830 --> 00:06:41,510
the truth.

169
00:06:41,510 --> 00:06:42,800
Have you been making or losing money

170
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:44,190
over these years of practicing law?

171
00:06:44,190 --> 00:06:45,450
What's that about now?

172
00:06:45,750 --> 00:06:46,990
I haven't lost money this month.

173
00:06:46,990 --> 00:06:48,250
There is some surplus.

174
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,240
That's what I waited to hear.

175
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:50,920
He has made

176
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:51,770
enough money to buy

177
00:06:51,770 --> 00:06:53,100
a train ticket to Nanyu.

178
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:55,640
Right.

179
00:06:56,390 --> 00:06:57,120
Just enough.

180
00:06:58,190 --> 00:06:59,040
Mr. Yuan will

181
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,830
try this case with us?

182
00:07:01,430 --> 00:07:01,800
Yes.

183
00:07:02,270 --> 00:07:03,000
There hasn't been

184
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,720
a word from the higher-ups yet.

185
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:05,980
We just decided to stop

186
00:07:06,210 --> 00:07:08,140
waiting and ask Mr. Yuan to step in.

187
00:07:08,500 --> 00:07:10,000
A big gun's joining us. That's enough,

188
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:10,600
right?

189
00:07:10,950 --> 00:07:11,550
Yes, sure.

190
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:12,240
Absolutely right.

191
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:12,630
Mr. Yuan,

192
00:07:12,630 --> 00:07:13,820
I know this case best.

193
00:07:13,820 --> 00:07:15,950
Come find me anytime you feel the need.

194
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:16,570
Mr. Yuan,

195
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,430
I know even more about this case.

196
00:07:19,430 --> 00:07:19,960
Feel free

197
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,060
to ask me anything.

198
00:07:21,270 --> 00:07:22,830
Very good, Mr. Qin.

199
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,480
Let's team up

200
00:07:24,870 --> 00:07:25,600
for the case,

201
00:07:25,630 --> 00:07:26,120
alright?

202
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:26,720
Yes, sure.

203
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:27,680
This is great.

204
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,010
Good.

205
00:07:28,430 --> 00:07:29,030
Very good.

206
00:07:29,430 --> 00:07:30,800
I'm so happy today.

207
00:07:31,510 --> 00:07:32,570
Thrilled, I'd say.

208
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,720
Me too. I just felt...

209
00:07:36,830 --> 00:07:38,980
As Yuan Yifang came in, I instantly felt

210
00:07:38,980 --> 00:07:40,070
that we were changing history,

211
00:07:40,070 --> 00:07:41,310
and that what we were doing

212
00:07:41,310 --> 00:07:42,159
could truly bring a change

213
00:07:42,159 --> 00:07:44,220
to China's current judicial system.

214
00:07:51,310 --> 00:07:53,240
I just got off the phone with Lihui.

215
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:55,090
Yizhong has been released.

216
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,140
Really?

217
00:08:00,070 --> 00:08:01,190
You look upset. Why?

218
00:08:01,190 --> 00:08:01,950
I'm not upset, am I?

219
00:08:01,950 --> 00:08:03,610
I'm certainly happy about it.

220
00:08:06,070 --> 00:08:06,830
My view is

221
00:08:08,310 --> 00:08:09,600
that his release means

222
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,040
those people have

223
00:08:11,070 --> 00:08:11,800
backed down.

224
00:08:13,110 --> 00:08:14,190
Given that, it might be easier

225
00:08:14,190 --> 00:08:15,650
to handle Li Xiang's case,

226
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:20,000
right?

227
00:08:38,549 --> 00:08:39,870
I'm not ready yet.

228
00:08:43,450 --> 00:08:45,970
When I kissed you on the train,

229
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,020
I knew you were awake.

230
00:08:47,020 --> 00:08:48,150
You weren't asleep.

231
00:08:49,870 --> 00:08:51,000
That doesn't count.

232
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,800
What will count then?

233
00:09:04,270 --> 00:09:04,840
Bravo!

234
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:14,960
Court Pres. Ding.

235
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:17,750
Come on in.

236
00:09:17,940 --> 00:09:18,940
Let me take a look.

237
00:09:20,670 --> 00:09:21,790
You seem fine.

238
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,600
I heard you were very popular

239
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,320
in there, weren't you?

240
00:09:28,630 --> 00:09:29,630
Court Pres. Ding.

241
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:30,560
Thank you.

242
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,150
I didn't do much.

243
00:09:32,150 --> 00:09:33,120
Why thank me?

244
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:34,600
Don't you worry.

245
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,360
This little experience of yours

246
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,270
won't be marked down

247
00:09:37,270 --> 00:09:38,330
in your appraisal.

248
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:41,010
I still have that little bit

249
00:09:42,030 --> 00:09:42,870
of power.

250
00:09:44,910 --> 00:09:46,040
I owe you an apology.

251
00:09:48,030 --> 00:09:49,150
For what?

252
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:50,630
It is only recently that I have

253
00:09:50,630 --> 00:09:52,160
started to understand you.

254
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:56,160
Actually, it wasn't lack of trying
that you didn't

255
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:57,720
do certain things before.

256
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:59,360
It was because there was
too much you couldn't say.

257
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:01,020
Alright, I'll stop you there.

258
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:01,600
I am not

259
00:10:01,630 --> 00:10:03,720
as aggrieved as you made it sound.

260
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:06,290
And I'm definitely not two-faced.

261
00:10:08,670 --> 00:10:09,790
Young man,

262
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,750
isn't it time to learn your lesson?

263
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:14,280
Or do you still want to

264
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,740
fight a losing battle?

265
00:10:18,670 --> 00:10:20,000
I can't do that anymore.

266
00:10:20,390 --> 00:10:21,650
I've thought about it.

267
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:22,850
That's not helpful.

268
00:10:23,270 --> 00:10:24,930
What I'm doing is more like...

269
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:27,390
attempting the impossible.

270
00:10:27,910 --> 00:10:29,440
I'll go on to strive in a different way

271
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:30,900
till I help Lawyer Li Xiang

272
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,080
clear his name,

273
00:10:32,390 --> 00:10:33,750
and till a well-rounded

274
00:10:33,870 --> 00:10:36,240
judicial system is established
in our country.

275
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:36,600
I...

276
00:10:37,510 --> 00:10:39,380
I really wish I could give you
a good slap.

277
00:10:39,380 --> 00:10:39,720
I do.

278
00:10:40,100 --> 00:10:41,230
I'm with you on that.

279
00:10:45,550 --> 00:10:46,550
Court Pres. Ding.

280
00:10:46,870 --> 00:10:47,730
It was you who told

281
00:10:47,730 --> 00:10:50,130
Zhang Lihui to ask my mother
to come, right?

282
00:10:55,630 --> 00:10:56,830
I'm not proud of that.

283
00:10:56,870 --> 00:10:57,730
Keep it secret.

284
00:10:58,470 --> 00:10:59,130
I got it.

285
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,510
Your mother...

286
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:05,390
is truly

287
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:08,470
a good mother.

288
00:11:13,790 --> 00:11:14,150
Mom.

289
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:16,340
Won't you stay a few more days?

290
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:18,280
Your dad can't be left unattended.

291
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:19,360
Can't be left unattended?

292
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:22,020
Doesn't he always complain
about your nagging?

293
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:23,320
Mom.

294
00:11:24,270 --> 00:11:25,360
When this case is over,

295
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,620
I'll take some time off

296
00:11:26,750 --> 00:11:27,950
and visit you and Dad.

297
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:29,240
I have so many questions

298
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,120
to ask Dad.

299
00:11:33,030 --> 00:11:35,550
A letter
from the Supreme People's Court came,

300
00:11:35,550 --> 00:11:37,150
transferring us to Beijing.

301
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,010
Back to Beijing?

302
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:41,220
Dad must be overjoyed.

303
00:11:41,550 --> 00:11:43,120
It's always been his dream to
return to Beijing.

304
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:44,580
Now, it finally came true.

305
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:46,750
Yizhong.

306
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,790
Your dad and I

307
00:11:55,140 --> 00:11:56,800
will meet you in Beijing.

308
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,040
See you there.

309
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:00,630
Eat up.

310
00:12:00,750 --> 00:12:01,080
Okay.

311
00:12:18,390 --> 00:12:19,000
Hello.

312
00:12:20,150 --> 00:12:21,410
How many in your party?

313
00:12:22,510 --> 00:12:24,200
Li Xiaowen works here, right?

314
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:27,540
Are you here to find someone or to eat?

315
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:29,040
Do I have to order food

316
00:12:29,150 --> 00:12:31,440
before asking to see someone here?

317
00:12:34,150 --> 00:12:35,600
What's your relationship with her?

318
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,460
I'm her father.

319
00:12:42,150 --> 00:12:44,210
Xiaowen, someone's looking for you.

320
00:12:45,550 --> 00:12:46,480
Coming right up!

321
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:06,250
I'm in Beijing for a business trip.

322
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:07,940
I thought I'd come see you.

323
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:09,600
I bought you a pair

324
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:11,280
of new sneakers.

325
00:13:11,390 --> 00:13:12,910
Try them on. See if they fit.

326
00:13:12,910 --> 00:13:14,840
I don't want these. Take them back.

327
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:15,790
I'm telling you,

328
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:17,050
I don't want to see you.

329
00:13:19,630 --> 00:13:21,160
We haven't met up for years.

330
00:13:23,750 --> 00:13:25,150
This time, I came here

331
00:13:25,790 --> 00:13:26,920
to apologize to you.

332
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:29,270
I really didn't know
that incident back then.

333
00:13:29,270 --> 00:13:30,480
If I had, I absolutely wouldn't...

334
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:31,480
Wouldn't do what?

335
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,620
What did you dare to do?

336
00:13:42,510 --> 00:13:43,080
I have to work.

337
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:43,550
Don't come find me again.

338
00:13:43,550 --> 00:13:44,410
Take the shoes!

339
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:45,890
I don't want them!

340
00:13:45,890 --> 00:13:47,300
Take them. Please.

341
00:13:47,750 --> 00:13:48,790
T-Take them.

342
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:49,940
Take the shoes.

343
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:52,560
Keep them.

344
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:13,100
Come eat, Xiaowen.

345
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:21,720
Thanks.

346
00:14:23,750 --> 00:14:25,080
He had the nerve to come.

347
00:14:25,510 --> 00:14:27,360
Even a vicious tiger won't eat its cubs.

348
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,120
But he pushed

349
00:14:28,390 --> 00:14:30,520
his own flesh and blood into a fire pit.

350
00:14:32,390 --> 00:14:33,990
He was not the one who hurt me.

351
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:35,130
It was my mother.

352
00:14:35,790 --> 00:14:37,320
He was an accessory at best.

353
00:14:37,630 --> 00:14:38,200
Why?

354
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:41,450
How come you never mentioned the details?

355
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:48,320
My father got seriously ill in the past.

356
00:14:48,670 --> 00:14:50,000
He coughed all the time.

357
00:14:50,670 --> 00:14:52,360
My mother, an uneducated woman,

358
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:53,030
brought back

359
00:14:53,030 --> 00:14:54,300
a quack doctor from nowhere.

360
00:14:54,300 --> 00:14:56,430
He said it was some kind of consumption

361
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:59,120
that would take
at least 2,000 yuan to cure.

362
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,440
So, your mom planned

363
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:01,910
to marry you off for a bride price

364
00:15:01,910 --> 00:15:02,910
of 2,000 yuan to save

365
00:15:02,910 --> 00:15:04,040
your father's life?

366
00:15:06,390 --> 00:15:07,720
Does he know about this?

367
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,930
Whether he knows or not doesn't

368
00:15:09,930 --> 00:15:10,600
change the fact

369
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:12,260
that I was used as a sacrifice.

370
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,130
So his life matters,

371
00:15:16,630 --> 00:15:17,790
but mine doesn't?

372
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:20,060
Forget about them.

373
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:20,960
Let's eat.

374
00:15:26,740 --> 00:15:29,320
Currently, the nation is launching
a severe crackdown

375
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:31,390
on criminal offenses.

376
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:33,270
Severe punitive measures are implemented

377
00:15:33,270 --> 00:15:35,410
against theft, pickpocketing,
and affray at bus stations.

378
00:15:35,410 --> 00:15:36,010
Zheng.

379
00:15:36,870 --> 00:15:38,150
Court Pres. Ding sent you here?

380
00:15:38,150 --> 00:15:39,000
Care for a bun?

381
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:40,770
Eat it yourself.

382
00:15:41,590 --> 00:15:43,050
This is getting bustling.

383
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:44,450
Lawyer Yuan Yifang.

384
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:47,000
Reporters from the People's Daily.

385
00:15:47,550 --> 00:15:49,010
Did you get the reporters?

386
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:50,920
Don't talk nonsense.

387
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:53,770
Yizhong.

388
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:01,690
You're back?

389
00:16:02,910 --> 00:16:03,510
Good work.

390
00:16:03,550 --> 00:16:04,210
No problem.

391
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:04,870
Wait.

392
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:06,550
Weren't you two supposed to take

393
00:16:06,550 --> 00:16:07,600
the same coach as Mr. Yuan?

394
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,860
We took an earlier one.

395
00:16:09,150 --> 00:16:10,150
Of course we must join you

396
00:16:10,150 --> 00:16:11,480
in witnessing history.

397
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:17,300
It should be this coach. Let's go.

398
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:24,910
That's Mr. Yuan. That one.

399
00:16:24,910 --> 00:16:25,440
Mr. Yuan!

400
00:16:25,630 --> 00:16:26,160
Mr. Yuan.

401
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:27,850
Hello, my name is Lu Zeming.

402
00:16:29,020 --> 00:16:29,600
Hello, Mr. Yuan.

403
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:30,600
I'm Chen Yizhong.

404
00:16:30,670 --> 00:16:31,650
So you're Chen Yizhong.

405
00:16:31,650 --> 00:16:32,780
I heard what you did.

406
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:33,740
Hello, Mr. Yuan.

407
00:16:33,740 --> 00:16:34,670
I'm Zhang Lihui.

408
00:16:34,790 --> 00:16:35,240
Mr. Yuan,

409
00:16:35,240 --> 00:16:36,200
the five of us are classmates.

410
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:37,130
Hello, Mr. Yuan!

411
00:16:39,150 --> 00:16:39,840
Mr. Yuan! Mr. Yuan!

412
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:40,550
Mr. Yuan!

413
00:16:41,550 --> 00:16:42,320
Qin Zhigao!

414
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:43,720
Qin Zhigao!

415
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,390
How dare you come back!

416
00:16:47,120 --> 00:16:48,250
Where have you been?

417
00:16:48,630 --> 00:16:49,090
Tell me!

418
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,450
Where have you been?

419
00:16:50,450 --> 00:16:51,450
Did you go be with

420
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:52,340
your mistress?

421
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:54,540
You even bought a present.

422
00:16:55,150 --> 00:16:56,090
Who is it for?

423
00:16:56,460 --> 00:16:58,260
Which lover did you buy this for?

424
00:16:58,550 --> 00:17:00,030
Did you spend the family's money?

425
00:17:00,030 --> 00:17:01,000
Take it! Take it!

426
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:02,180
I bought it for you!

427
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:04,510
I was out meeting Xiaowen!

428
00:17:04,510 --> 00:17:05,569
I was with Xiaowen!

429
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:06,790
She hates this family

430
00:17:06,790 --> 00:17:08,790
and refuses to come back ever again!

431
00:17:08,839 --> 00:17:10,069
What else can you do
besides making a scene

432
00:17:10,069 --> 00:17:11,530
and threatening suicide?

433
00:17:11,550 --> 00:17:13,109
Qin Zhigao!

434
00:17:13,550 --> 00:17:14,829
Qin Zhigao!

435
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,000
You scoundrel!

436
00:17:17,589 --> 00:17:19,390
How dare you say Xiaowen's name!

437
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:21,000
You scoundrel!

438
00:17:21,440 --> 00:17:22,550
Will Mr. Yuan's

439
00:17:22,790 --> 00:17:23,670
family affairs

440
00:17:23,720 --> 00:17:24,920
cause trouble?

441
00:17:26,750 --> 00:17:28,590
This is indeed a bit of a headache.

442
00:17:28,590 --> 00:17:29,850
How about I talk to him?

443
00:17:32,550 --> 00:17:34,080
Let's go to the hotel first.

444
00:17:34,120 --> 00:17:35,000
Okay.

445
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:45,330
You're all here.

446
00:17:46,350 --> 00:17:47,550
What brings you here?

447
00:17:56,110 --> 00:17:57,040
You got injured?

448
00:17:59,240 --> 00:17:59,770
I'm fine.

449
00:18:01,270 --> 00:18:02,510
Did it ever cross your mind

450
00:18:02,510 --> 00:18:03,960
that you might never be released

451
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:06,290
and get sentenced? What would you do then?

452
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:08,350
I didn't get sentenced, did I?

453
00:18:08,350 --> 00:18:09,810
You sound just like my mom.

454
00:18:11,480 --> 00:18:12,110
You should have

455
00:18:12,110 --> 00:18:13,680
discussed with us beforehand.

456
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:14,920
You were willful and brainless

457
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:15,920
when you did that.

458
00:18:17,790 --> 00:18:19,190
At that time, I was indeed

459
00:18:19,550 --> 00:18:20,610
acting on impulse.

460
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:22,910
But we couldn't have discussed it,

461
00:18:22,910 --> 00:18:24,560
since you wouldn't have agreed to do it.

462
00:18:24,560 --> 00:18:25,440
The problem was you didn't

463
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:26,770
even give us a headsup.t

464
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:28,800
Everyone was worried about you.

465
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:31,160
I've apologized to everyone.

466
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:32,960
Let me say sorry to you once again.

467
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:34,490
Why apologize to her at all?

468
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:36,400
In fact, you don't

469
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:37,730
need to apologize to us.

470
00:18:45,070 --> 00:18:47,200
Yizhong, I've been meaning to ask you.

471
00:18:48,240 --> 00:18:48,960
Did you think you'd never

472
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:49,760
be sentenced?

473
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:51,730
I didn't think that far.

474
00:18:55,070 --> 00:18:56,880
By that, do you mean...

475
00:18:58,440 --> 00:18:59,640
you weren't worried,

476
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:00,860
or you were sure

477
00:19:02,110 --> 00:19:04,170
that those behind you would help you?

478
00:19:05,720 --> 00:19:06,510
Uh, Yizhong,

479
00:19:06,530 --> 00:19:07,860
go out with me for a word.

480
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:08,930
Just say it here.

481
00:19:09,070 --> 00:19:11,130
Hurry up. I'll apply medicine on you.

482
00:19:11,490 --> 00:19:12,000
Come on!

483
00:19:29,750 --> 00:19:31,160
Don't bicker with them.

484
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:33,240
Their relationship changed

485
00:19:33,340 --> 00:19:36,000
after the trip to Beijing.
They're a couple now.

486
00:19:46,820 --> 00:19:47,680
Care for a half?

487
00:20:04,350 --> 00:20:05,640
Why did you say that?

488
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:07,310
Say what?

489
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:10,520
Wasn't that a compliment to him?

490
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:12,340
On his brilliance and wisdom.

491
00:20:14,400 --> 00:20:16,070
Your opinion is that he did all that
because he knew

492
00:20:16,070 --> 00:20:17,470
he was backed by someone.

493
00:20:18,790 --> 00:20:20,320
Actually, that's not true.

494
00:20:20,890 --> 00:20:21,970
In this small town,

495
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:22,660
there is no such thing

496
00:20:22,660 --> 00:20:24,060
as a mature legal system.

497
00:20:25,720 --> 00:20:27,070
Anything could happen.

498
00:20:32,070 --> 00:20:32,870
Let me ask you.

499
00:20:34,840 --> 00:20:35,680
If the same thing

500
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:36,550
happened to me,

501
00:20:38,480 --> 00:20:40,340
do you think Mr. Zhou and Mr. Cheng

502
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:42,200
would treat me the same way?

503
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:42,960
Of course.

504
00:20:45,070 --> 00:20:46,640
Not just Mr. Zhou and Mr. Cheng,

505
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:48,510
we would all treat you the same way.

506
00:20:48,510 --> 00:20:49,920
We would be worried about you

507
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:51,780
and figure out solutions for you.

508
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:55,920
Got it.

509
00:21:23,270 --> 00:21:24,400
Who are you here for?

510
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:26,620
For me.

511
00:21:31,070 --> 00:21:31,640
Mr. Qin,

512
00:21:31,920 --> 00:21:33,750
shall we talk somewhere else?

513
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:34,890
Here is fine.

514
00:21:35,550 --> 00:21:37,210
Just pretend he's not around.

515
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:38,460
I'd do that anyway.

516
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:44,060
Mr. Yuan would like

517
00:21:44,160 --> 00:21:45,270
to have your opinion

518
00:21:45,270 --> 00:21:46,000
on a matter.

519
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:48,000
A big shot such as himself

520
00:21:48,680 --> 00:21:50,080
is asking for my opinion?

521
00:21:50,270 --> 00:21:51,680
He should feel free to decide.

522
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:53,160
Here is what Mr. Yuan thinks.

523
00:21:53,160 --> 00:21:55,070
This case is of great significance

524
00:21:55,070 --> 00:21:56,720
and is affected by many external factors.

525
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:57,920
The pressure is mounting.

526
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,000
If it's handled

527
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:00,000
by a local lawyer,

528
00:22:00,070 --> 00:22:01,730
the future is hard to predict.

529
00:22:02,240 --> 00:22:03,900
How very cautious of Mr. Yuan.

530
00:22:04,510 --> 00:22:05,390
You see, he'll leave

531
00:22:05,390 --> 00:22:06,560
after finishing his part,

532
00:22:06,560 --> 00:22:07,960
while you have to continue living

533
00:22:07,960 --> 00:22:08,960
and working here.

534
00:22:09,310 --> 00:22:09,970
Therefore,

535
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,860
considering your own safety,

536
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:12,760
Mr. Yuan

537
00:22:12,790 --> 00:22:13,880
would like to know if you will still

538
00:22:13,880 --> 00:22:15,550
represent the defendant with him.

539
00:22:15,550 --> 00:22:17,010
If you do feel torn inside,

540
00:22:17,270 --> 00:22:18,330
he'll do it himself

541
00:22:18,510 --> 00:22:19,970
or invite another lawyer.

542
00:22:20,440 --> 00:22:22,110
Mr. Yuan practices law

543
00:22:22,350 --> 00:22:23,640
all over the country.

544
00:22:24,110 --> 00:22:25,570
He should be experienced.

545
00:22:25,720 --> 00:22:27,780
Why would he ask me this question now?

546
00:22:28,250 --> 00:22:29,680
I guess this never concerned him

547
00:22:29,680 --> 00:22:31,610
until he arrived here and received

548
00:22:31,880 --> 00:22:33,480
information from all sides.

549
00:22:34,270 --> 00:22:34,880
I got it.

550
00:22:36,410 --> 00:22:38,010
He considers me a burden now.

551
00:22:38,220 --> 00:22:39,960
Mr. Qin, you've misunderstood it.

552
00:22:39,960 --> 00:22:41,310
The truth is not like that.

553
00:22:41,310 --> 00:22:42,550
Mr. Yuan said

554
00:22:42,790 --> 00:22:43,520
that in name,

555
00:22:43,960 --> 00:22:45,200
you're still a defense lawyer

556
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:46,000
for this case.

557
00:22:53,380 --> 00:22:54,440
What are you doing?

558
00:22:59,680 --> 00:23:01,400
Please tell Mr. Yuan Yifang

559
00:23:02,720 --> 00:23:04,380
that even if it rains daggers,

560
00:23:04,570 --> 00:23:05,830
I'll still stand with him

561
00:23:05,830 --> 00:23:07,960
to defend Li Xiang and Hong Zhansheng.

562
00:23:08,270 --> 00:23:10,070
By that, I mean in the courtroom.

563
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:11,720
Got it.

564
00:23:15,710 --> 00:23:18,350
[Defense Authorization Letter]

565
00:23:20,400 --> 00:23:21,800
Mr. Yuan, I didn't expect

566
00:23:22,270 --> 00:23:24,590
that you would personally handle my case.

567
00:23:24,590 --> 00:23:25,650
My life's worth it.

568
00:23:27,750 --> 00:23:29,740
Mr. Yuan, thank you so much for your time

569
00:23:29,740 --> 00:23:31,200
on this tiny case about me.

570
00:23:31,970 --> 00:23:33,000
Mr. Yuan is very busy.

571
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:33,970
He turned down

572
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:35,660
many big cases just for yours.

573
00:23:37,080 --> 00:23:37,480
Sit.

574
00:23:37,750 --> 00:23:38,270
Ma,

575
00:23:38,750 --> 00:23:40,160
what big cases have I turned down

576
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:40,920
lately, huh?

577
00:23:41,550 --> 00:23:42,880
Stop talking nonsense.

578
00:23:46,550 --> 00:23:47,480
Lawyer Li Xiang,

579
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:48,510
your case

580
00:23:48,510 --> 00:23:49,510
is not a small one.

581
00:23:49,880 --> 00:23:50,440
How are we

582
00:23:50,440 --> 00:23:51,700
supposed to do our jobs

583
00:23:51,720 --> 00:23:53,850
in the future if we turn our backs to it?

584
00:23:56,030 --> 00:23:57,720
You are suffering and being put to test

585
00:23:57,720 --> 00:23:58,380
for lawyers

586
00:23:58,480 --> 00:23:59,610
across the country.

587
00:24:00,310 --> 00:24:01,840
It's my duty to contribute.

588
00:24:04,030 --> 00:24:05,630
But I might not be able to win.

589
00:24:07,350 --> 00:24:08,610
That said, win or lose,

590
00:24:08,790 --> 00:24:09,720
this experience of yours

591
00:24:09,720 --> 00:24:10,920
surely has its value.

592
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:15,810
Mr. Yuan,

593
00:24:16,520 --> 00:24:18,030
my supervisor, Director Hong Zhansheng,

594
00:24:18,030 --> 00:24:19,310
was arrested along with me.

595
00:24:19,310 --> 00:24:20,440
I-Is he being

596
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:21,240
represented?

597
00:24:22,070 --> 00:24:22,800
Don't worry.

598
00:24:23,540 --> 00:24:25,140
There are lawyers out there,

599
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:27,100
from the bar association.

600
00:24:27,550 --> 00:24:28,810
I'm just the vanguard.

601
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:29,920
More will follow.

602
00:24:30,500 --> 00:24:31,830
The lawyers representing Director Hong

603
00:24:31,830 --> 00:24:33,430
were handpicked by Mr. Yuan.

604
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:35,030
They're all highly experienced.

605
00:24:35,030 --> 00:24:36,160
Yes, I did pick them.

606
00:24:36,410 --> 00:24:37,720
That's because I must pick

607
00:24:37,720 --> 00:24:40,250
some lawyers
with a higher win rate than mine.

608
00:24:41,120 --> 00:24:42,350
The chips can't be all put on me.

609
00:24:42,350 --> 00:24:43,680
The stakes are too high.

610
00:24:45,350 --> 00:24:45,810
Come on.

611
00:24:46,030 --> 00:24:47,490
Let's talk about the case.

612
00:24:50,700 --> 00:24:51,370
Well...

613
00:24:58,560 --> 00:25:00,220
Come on. Let's get it started.

614
00:25:02,470 --> 00:25:03,000
Okay.

615
00:25:03,920 --> 00:25:05,250
You're going to listen?

616
00:25:05,590 --> 00:25:06,920
Then find a place to sit.

617
00:25:06,960 --> 00:25:08,620
The talk will take a long time.

618
00:25:16,030 --> 00:25:17,480
The procuratorate

619
00:25:17,480 --> 00:25:19,080
is acting as the pioneer now.

620
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:21,010
But at the end of the day,

621
00:25:21,510 --> 00:25:23,590
it'll still be us who end the whole thing.

622
00:25:23,590 --> 00:25:24,920
There's no escaping it.

623
00:25:25,440 --> 00:25:26,170
Who do you say

624
00:25:26,790 --> 00:25:28,250
should be the chief judge?

625
00:25:32,550 --> 00:25:33,080
Who is it?

626
00:25:33,590 --> 00:25:34,250
Ding,

627
00:25:34,750 --> 00:25:35,880
this is Su Guosheng.

628
00:25:38,240 --> 00:25:39,300
Any instructions?

629
00:25:39,510 --> 00:25:40,240
I heard

630
00:25:40,270 --> 00:25:41,370
a lawyer named Yuan something

631
00:25:41,370 --> 00:25:42,610
from Beijing

632
00:25:43,160 --> 00:25:44,270
plans to defend that rogue lawyer,

633
00:25:44,270 --> 00:25:44,950
huh?

634
00:25:45,330 --> 00:25:46,660
This guy has quite a reputation.

635
00:25:46,660 --> 00:25:48,000
He's coming aggressively.

636
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,440
Are you aware of this?

637
00:25:50,640 --> 00:25:51,550
Is it true?

638
00:25:51,960 --> 00:25:52,650
I-I...

639
00:25:52,880 --> 00:25:53,880
never heard of it.

640
00:25:54,320 --> 00:25:55,200
He's now staying

641
00:25:55,200 --> 00:25:56,370
in your court's guesthouse,

642
00:25:56,370 --> 00:25:58,040
right under your nose.

643
00:26:01,110 --> 00:26:01,750
How about

644
00:26:02,310 --> 00:26:03,330
I have him

645
00:26:03,880 --> 00:26:04,540
kicked out?

646
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:05,400
No need.

647
00:26:05,960 --> 00:26:06,850
Let him stay.

648
00:26:07,250 --> 00:26:08,200
Your doors are open to guests.

649
00:26:08,200 --> 00:26:09,400
What's there to be afraid of?

650
00:26:09,400 --> 00:26:10,860
That said, you have to know

651
00:26:10,930 --> 00:26:13,070
that evil forces attempting
to undermine our crackdown

652
00:26:13,070 --> 00:26:14,930
on crime are plotting something.

653
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:17,000
The odds are stacking up against us.

654
00:26:17,830 --> 00:26:20,490
Then, has the procuratorate
prepared anything

655
00:26:20,720 --> 00:26:21,750
for this

656
00:26:22,480 --> 00:26:23,410
Yuan something?

657
00:26:23,830 --> 00:26:26,070
One lawyer is nothing to worry about.

658
00:26:27,050 --> 00:26:28,970
But the trend and ideology

659
00:26:29,000 --> 00:26:29,860
embodied by him

660
00:26:30,160 --> 00:26:31,240
mean a lot.

661
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:33,400
Therefore,

662
00:26:34,400 --> 00:26:36,200
this time, your court must stand

663
00:26:36,790 --> 00:26:39,070
in unity with the procuratorate

664
00:26:39,270 --> 00:26:40,750
to resolutely and decisively

665
00:26:40,750 --> 00:26:42,480
make this case an ironclad one.

666
00:26:44,440 --> 00:26:45,440
Understood.

667
00:26:45,790 --> 00:26:46,590
Rest assured.

668
00:26:55,790 --> 00:26:57,120
The higher-ups ordered

669
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:58,620
this case to be resolutely

670
00:26:59,240 --> 00:27:00,440
and decisively built

671
00:27:00,880 --> 00:27:02,080
into an ironclad one.

672
00:27:05,480 --> 00:27:06,610
Sounds about right.

673
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:08,060
Court Pres. Zhang,

674
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:09,590
in our court,

675
00:27:10,350 --> 00:27:12,350
you're the most decisive.

676
00:27:13,000 --> 00:27:14,800
Why don't you be the chief judge?

677
00:27:16,230 --> 00:27:16,720
Me?

678
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:18,640
Ding,

679
00:27:20,070 --> 00:27:21,800
i-it's not appropriate, is it?

680
00:27:21,970 --> 00:27:23,480
I don't work on the judicial side.

681
00:27:23,480 --> 00:27:24,880
Making me the chief judge

682
00:27:25,030 --> 00:27:26,690
would be a bit of a joke, right?

683
00:27:34,830 --> 00:27:35,240
Zhang.

684
00:27:39,640 --> 00:27:40,810
Fine.

685
00:27:40,920 --> 00:27:42,960
I won't force you guys, okay?

686
00:27:45,970 --> 00:27:49,000
Since everyone fears hardship,

687
00:27:52,440 --> 00:27:53,550
let me do it then.

688
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:56,480
Over the past few days,

689
00:27:56,480 --> 00:27:57,960
I've carefully read the indictment

690
00:27:57,960 --> 00:28:00,030
and the evidence list
from the procuratorate

691
00:28:00,030 --> 00:28:00,920
again.

692
00:28:02,400 --> 00:28:03,150
I believe

693
00:28:04,250 --> 00:28:05,680
they also think the allegation

694
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:06,810
is a bit of a stretch,

695
00:28:07,440 --> 00:28:08,570
with weak evidence.

696
00:28:09,640 --> 00:28:10,340
So...

697
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:11,010
Mr. Yuan.

698
00:28:12,830 --> 00:28:13,970
I have a question.

699
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:15,830
Now that the procuratorate also finds

700
00:28:15,830 --> 00:28:17,030
the evidence too weak

701
00:28:17,310 --> 00:28:18,540
or insufficient,

702
00:28:19,030 --> 00:28:21,360
why do they carry on with the prosecution?

703
00:28:22,160 --> 00:28:23,020
Good question.

704
00:28:24,070 --> 00:28:24,670
True that.

705
00:28:25,440 --> 00:28:27,770
Why do they carry on with the prosecution?

706
00:28:29,110 --> 00:28:30,640
Are some people having problems

707
00:28:30,640 --> 00:28:31,570
with us lawyers?

708
00:28:31,640 --> 00:28:33,000
Or do they hold a personal grudge

709
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:34,270
against Hong Zhansheng

710
00:28:34,270 --> 00:28:35,270
and want revenge?

711
00:28:35,290 --> 00:28:37,620
Or are some people
just out of their minds?

712
00:28:38,880 --> 00:28:40,080
Stop laughing. Stop.

713
00:28:40,310 --> 00:28:41,710
I'm not being sarcastic.

714
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:43,460
By that, I meant something

715
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:44,880
might have gone wrong with

716
00:28:44,880 --> 00:28:46,070
their understanding,

717
00:28:46,070 --> 00:28:46,680
thoughts,

718
00:28:47,110 --> 00:28:47,970
or perception.

719
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:50,350
They think that we lawyers

720
00:28:51,630 --> 00:28:53,560
defending criminals is one thing,

721
00:28:54,160 --> 00:28:56,690
but pleading not guilty
for a death row inmate

722
00:28:57,400 --> 00:28:58,730
is just pushing too far.

723
00:28:59,270 --> 00:29:00,640
They deem it unreasonable.

724
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:02,240
They call it blatant harboring,

725
00:29:02,240 --> 00:29:03,180
a crime as well.

726
00:29:07,720 --> 00:29:08,870
China has just reinstated

727
00:29:08,870 --> 00:29:09,930
its lawyer system.

728
00:29:10,440 --> 00:29:12,110
People lack a unified understanding

729
00:29:12,110 --> 00:29:12,770
of lawyers'

730
00:29:13,030 --> 00:29:14,720
value, mission and role

731
00:29:14,820 --> 00:29:16,070
in the legal system.

732
00:29:16,960 --> 00:29:18,090
This is inevitable.

733
00:29:18,680 --> 00:29:20,610
You are quite considerate of them.

734
00:29:20,680 --> 00:29:21,550
"Inevitable."

735
00:29:21,880 --> 00:29:22,750
"Excusable."

736
00:29:23,590 --> 00:29:25,450
Then how do we defend our clients?

737
00:29:25,600 --> 00:29:27,200
That's also a good question.

738
00:29:27,400 --> 00:29:27,750
Yeah.

739
00:29:28,310 --> 00:29:29,030
How?

740
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:30,070
As lawyers,

741
00:29:30,310 --> 00:29:31,790
the first thing we need to do

742
00:29:31,790 --> 00:29:32,640
is align our understanding

743
00:29:32,640 --> 00:29:33,440
and thinking.

744
00:29:33,720 --> 00:29:34,270
What's the purpose

745
00:29:34,270 --> 00:29:35,530
of pleading not guilty

746
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:36,370
in this case?

747
00:29:37,480 --> 00:29:38,200
Any views?

748
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:47,270
The purpose is to protect Li Xiang

749
00:29:47,270 --> 00:29:48,400
and Hong Zhansheng,

750
00:29:48,400 --> 00:29:49,720
to defend the lawyer system,

751
00:29:49,720 --> 00:29:51,780
and to improve China's legal system!

752
00:29:51,830 --> 00:29:52,960
-Bravo!
-Well said!

753
00:29:58,480 --> 00:29:59,080
Very good.

754
00:29:59,590 --> 00:30:00,250
Keep going.

755
00:30:00,680 --> 00:30:01,280
What else?

756
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:03,960
To expand influence. Does it count?

757
00:30:03,960 --> 00:30:05,350
To make you more influential.

758
00:30:05,350 --> 00:30:06,680
In similar future lawsuits,

759
00:30:06,680 --> 00:30:07,400
when you step in,

760
00:30:07,400 --> 00:30:09,600
the opponents will be deterred, right?

761
00:30:12,270 --> 00:30:13,400
I need to think about

762
00:30:13,480 --> 00:30:15,010
how to reply to your answer,

763
00:30:15,310 --> 00:30:16,070
since I'm truly pleased

764
00:30:16,070 --> 00:30:17,730
about your flattery remarks.

765
00:30:21,790 --> 00:30:23,030
But who the heck am I?

766
00:30:27,030 --> 00:30:27,830
In my opinion,

767
00:30:28,920 --> 00:30:29,980
more importantly,

768
00:30:30,880 --> 00:30:32,790
this time, by defending Li and Hong,
we should

769
00:30:32,790 --> 00:30:34,270
raise people's awareness.

770
00:30:34,270 --> 00:30:35,870
We must let everyone realize

771
00:30:37,440 --> 00:30:38,300
that we lawyers

772
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:40,200
and the lawyer system

773
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:41,900
are an indispensable part

774
00:30:41,900 --> 00:30:43,500
of China's judicial system.

775
00:30:43,880 --> 00:30:45,510
We lawyers are not the opposite

776
00:30:45,510 --> 00:30:48,110
or enemies of the procuratorate
and the court.

777
00:30:48,240 --> 00:30:49,810
Together with them,

778
00:30:49,830 --> 00:30:52,760
we constitute the main body
of China's legal system.

779
00:30:59,400 --> 00:31:00,000
Well said!

780
00:31:12,400 --> 00:31:13,400
Court Pres. Ding.

781
00:31:14,440 --> 00:31:14,920
Mr. Sun,

782
00:31:15,310 --> 00:31:15,960
a bowl of noodles?

783
00:31:15,960 --> 00:31:16,760
No, not for me.

784
00:31:17,690 --> 00:31:18,550
The procuratorate

785
00:31:18,550 --> 00:31:19,410
is swamped now.

786
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:21,030
How do you have

787
00:31:21,030 --> 00:31:22,160
the mood for noodles?

788
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:23,830
Are you skipping meals to supervise

789
00:31:23,830 --> 00:31:24,360
the work?

790
00:31:24,470 --> 00:31:25,270
No, I'm not.

791
00:31:26,030 --> 00:31:27,890
I just met Chief Prosecutor Guan.

792
00:31:27,960 --> 00:31:29,420
Won't you go get prepared?

793
00:31:29,640 --> 00:31:30,270
For what?

794
00:31:30,920 --> 00:31:31,750
For that case.

795
00:31:32,780 --> 00:31:33,590
My supervisor has been

796
00:31:33,590 --> 00:31:35,200
taking sleeping pills for a week,

797
00:31:35,200 --> 00:31:36,720
but he still wakes up at 4 or 5.

798
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:37,780
He's stressed out,

799
00:31:37,880 --> 00:31:39,400
though he doesn't say it.

800
00:31:39,550 --> 00:31:40,680
Who isn't stressed?

801
00:31:41,590 --> 00:31:42,990
It's true that I look calm

802
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:44,030
and composed,

803
00:31:44,640 --> 00:31:46,590
but I'm actually having butterflies

804
00:31:46,590 --> 00:31:47,450
in the stomach.

805
00:31:48,240 --> 00:31:49,270
Guan is so anxious that he is

806
00:31:49,270 --> 00:31:50,830
having prostate obstruction.

807
00:31:50,830 --> 00:31:53,160
It takes him half an hour to make a pee.

808
00:31:55,720 --> 00:31:57,180
Forgive me for being nosy.

809
00:31:57,960 --> 00:32:00,290
Will you preside over the trial in person?

810
00:32:02,110 --> 00:32:02,770
I assure you

811
00:32:03,160 --> 00:32:05,090
I will enforce the law impartially

812
00:32:05,440 --> 00:32:06,850
and make a fair judgment

813
00:32:07,160 --> 00:32:09,890
that can stand the test
of the people and history.

814
00:32:09,900 --> 00:32:10,450
Alright?

815
00:32:11,720 --> 00:32:13,520
Of course it should be like that.

816
00:32:14,480 --> 00:32:15,300
May I eat now?

817
00:32:16,000 --> 00:32:17,200
Sure. Take your time.

818
00:32:18,110 --> 00:32:18,640
Oh right.

819
00:32:19,510 --> 00:32:20,160
I heard

820
00:32:20,270 --> 00:32:21,350
Lawyer Yuan Yifang

821
00:32:22,110 --> 00:32:23,750
is giving a lecture
at the No. 2 Mine Club,

822
00:32:23,750 --> 00:32:25,110
holding a spirited discussion.

823
00:32:25,110 --> 00:32:27,240
Won't you send someone to look into it?

824
00:32:27,350 --> 00:32:27,920
Mr. Sun,

825
00:32:29,160 --> 00:32:31,030
don't be mistaken.

826
00:32:32,030 --> 00:32:33,560
I'm an officer of the court,

827
00:32:33,790 --> 00:32:35,590
not the public security bureau.

828
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:37,380
I spoke out of turn. Eat up.

829
00:32:37,380 --> 00:32:37,790
Okay.

830
00:32:48,790 --> 00:32:50,250
This is an excellent opportunity

831
00:32:50,250 --> 00:32:51,070
to bring light on

832
00:32:51,070 --> 00:32:52,110
the difficulties faced by lawyers

833
00:32:52,110 --> 00:32:52,480
in criminal defense.

834
00:32:52,480 --> 00:32:53,610
Are you here as a spy?

835
00:32:54,160 --> 00:32:55,440
No, I'm here to learn.

836
00:32:55,880 --> 00:32:56,410
Oh right.

837
00:32:56,550 --> 00:32:57,830
I brought the book back for you.

838
00:32:57,830 --> 00:32:58,430
What book?

839
00:32:58,440 --> 00:32:59,370
No more talking.

840
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:05,750
We should not only fight for
a verdict of not guilty,

841
00:33:05,750 --> 00:33:07,750
but also require the procuratorate

842
00:33:07,850 --> 00:33:08,830
and the court to publish

843
00:33:08,830 --> 00:33:09,430
an apology

844
00:33:09,440 --> 00:33:11,100
to Hong and Li in the newspaper

845
00:33:11,310 --> 00:33:12,000
and clear their names.

846
00:33:12,000 --> 00:33:12,790
Only in this way

847
00:33:12,790 --> 00:33:13,590
can our defense

848
00:33:13,590 --> 00:33:14,590
be proved

849
00:33:14,610 --> 00:33:15,340
successful.

850
00:33:24,610 --> 00:33:25,550
I beg to differ.

851
00:33:27,720 --> 00:33:28,510
As lawyers,

852
00:33:30,030 --> 00:33:31,400
our professional ethics

853
00:33:31,400 --> 00:33:32,110
require us

854
00:33:32,570 --> 00:33:34,370
to prioritize our clients'

855
00:33:34,400 --> 00:33:35,160
interests.

856
00:33:35,590 --> 00:33:37,350
Now, for the two clients, Li and Hong,

857
00:33:37,350 --> 00:33:38,790
their greatest interest lies in

858
00:33:38,790 --> 00:33:40,070
restoring their personal freedom

859
00:33:40,070 --> 00:33:41,200
as soon as possible.

860
00:33:41,350 --> 00:33:41,920
For that,

861
00:33:42,750 --> 00:33:44,750
if they are willing to concede,

862
00:33:45,240 --> 00:33:46,370
we'll show respect.

863
00:33:47,550 --> 00:33:49,880
Also, we must respect the procuratorate

864
00:33:49,880 --> 00:33:50,830
and the court.

865
00:33:53,880 --> 00:33:55,680
Let me remind you all once again.

866
00:33:55,830 --> 00:33:56,750
We're not in a life-and-death

867
00:33:56,750 --> 00:33:58,550
struggle with the prosecution.

868
00:33:59,400 --> 00:34:00,880
Through this case, we aim to

869
00:34:00,880 --> 00:34:03,400
distinguish right from wrong
with everyone,

870
00:34:03,400 --> 00:34:04,200
and to clarify

871
00:34:04,520 --> 00:34:05,450
the boundary

872
00:34:05,480 --> 00:34:07,240
between guilt and innocence

873
00:34:07,440 --> 00:34:09,190
in criminal defense involving lawyers

874
00:34:09,190 --> 00:34:11,050
so as to highlight the importance

875
00:34:11,280 --> 00:34:13,880
of the lawyer system
in China's judicial system.

876
00:34:13,880 --> 00:34:15,340
This is what matters most.

877
00:34:19,360 --> 00:34:20,320
Hold your applause.

878
00:34:20,320 --> 00:34:20,920
I think

879
00:34:21,230 --> 00:34:22,110
this is even

880
00:34:22,130 --> 00:34:23,630
more important than the result

881
00:34:23,630 --> 00:34:24,690
of the case itself.

882
00:34:29,110 --> 00:34:29,670
Mr. Yuan,

883
00:34:30,230 --> 00:34:31,770
there are many reporters outside.

884
00:34:31,770 --> 00:34:32,370
Shall we

885
00:34:32,400 --> 00:34:34,150
spread our ideas?

886
00:34:34,400 --> 00:34:35,929
It might benefit the trial.

887
00:34:36,510 --> 00:34:37,310
I don't agree.

888
00:34:37,800 --> 00:34:38,840
I really hate

889
00:34:39,050 --> 00:34:40,590
to pressure the prosecution and the court

890
00:34:40,590 --> 00:34:41,790
with public opinion,

891
00:34:42,550 --> 00:34:44,210
as it's a double-edged sword.

892
00:34:45,230 --> 00:34:46,690
Today's selfless support

893
00:34:46,880 --> 00:34:48,710
would very likely turn into tomorrow's

894
00:34:48,710 --> 00:34:49,840
ruthless backlash.

895
00:34:50,190 --> 00:34:50,790
The public

896
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:53,330
does not necessarily represent justice.

897
00:34:53,800 --> 00:34:56,060
I would rather fight for justice in court

898
00:34:56,150 --> 00:34:57,960
under procedural justice.

899
00:34:59,280 --> 00:35:00,940
Only that is the most valuable

900
00:35:00,960 --> 00:35:02,230
and convincing.

901
00:35:08,760 --> 00:35:09,890
I want to be a lawyer.

902
00:35:10,480 --> 00:35:11,030
I want to be

903
00:35:11,030 --> 00:35:12,490
a lawyer like Yuan Yifang.

904
00:35:28,190 --> 00:35:30,230
Ding, oh, Ding,

905
00:35:30,800 --> 00:35:32,550
why go to such trouble?

906
00:35:31,990 --> 00:35:33,550
[Defendants: Li Xiang, Hong Zhansheng]

907
00:35:36,400 --> 00:35:37,400
Court Pres. Ding.

908
00:35:38,110 --> 00:35:38,710
It's time.

909
00:35:41,760 --> 00:35:42,880
Perhaps...

910
00:35:43,800 --> 00:35:45,150
either side could win.

911
00:35:46,880 --> 00:35:49,280
But I'll definitely be the ultimate loser.

912
00:35:50,550 --> 00:35:52,610
As long as China's legal system wins.

913
00:35:55,110 --> 00:35:56,040
What did you say?

914
00:35:56,710 --> 00:35:57,630
I... I said

915
00:35:58,510 --> 00:35:59,510
it'd be a sure win.

916
00:36:08,400 --> 00:36:09,200
We have to win.

917
00:36:09,830 --> 00:36:10,490
Hold still.

918
00:36:10,960 --> 00:36:12,160
Let me take a picture.

919
00:36:14,150 --> 00:36:15,670
One, two, three.

920
00:36:16,480 --> 00:36:16,880
Done.

921
00:36:19,970 --> 00:36:20,800
How come I feel like

922
00:36:20,800 --> 00:36:22,020
I'm standing in the middle of history now,

923
00:36:22,020 --> 00:36:22,550
Yingjie?

924
00:36:22,880 --> 00:36:23,610
"Feel like"?

925
00:36:23,760 --> 00:36:25,620
You're right about that feeling.

926
00:36:28,220 --> 00:36:28,920
Comrades,

927
00:36:29,150 --> 00:36:30,010
I am a reporter.

928
00:36:30,600 --> 00:36:31,320
Can I ask you some questions

929
00:36:31,320 --> 00:36:32,590
about that lawyer's case?

930
00:36:32,590 --> 00:36:33,360
Sure, we...

931
00:36:33,360 --> 00:36:33,920
We don't do interviews.

932
00:36:33,920 --> 00:36:34,780
No interviews?

933
00:36:35,150 --> 00:36:36,880
Please don't ask us questions.

934
00:36:37,230 --> 00:36:38,320
I'm sorry then.

935
00:36:38,360 --> 00:36:38,960
It's okay.

936
00:36:39,070 --> 00:36:39,530
Not a problem.

937
00:36:39,530 --> 00:36:40,790
Could you do us a favor?

938
00:36:41,150 --> 00:36:41,750
What is it?

939
00:36:42,030 --> 00:36:42,670
Can you take a photo

940
00:36:42,670 --> 00:36:43,600
of the five of us?

941
00:36:43,920 --> 00:36:44,710
Sure thing.

942
00:36:45,190 --> 00:36:46,000
With my camera

943
00:36:46,000 --> 00:36:46,550
or yours?

944
00:36:46,800 --> 00:36:47,400
With this.

945
00:36:47,510 --> 00:36:47,840
Okay.

946
00:36:48,190 --> 00:36:48,720
Alright.

947
00:36:49,760 --> 00:36:50,760
That's even better.

948
00:36:50,760 --> 00:36:52,320
With this as the background,

949
00:36:52,320 --> 00:36:52,630
right?

950
00:36:52,630 --> 00:36:53,090
Right.

951
00:36:53,120 --> 00:36:53,970
Got it.

952
00:36:54,320 --> 00:36:55,920
Come down here a bit, please.

953
00:37:00,150 --> 00:37:00,630
Alright.

954
00:37:00,630 --> 00:37:02,630
A full-body shot or a half-body one?

955
00:37:03,630 --> 00:37:04,590
What about both?

956
00:37:04,710 --> 00:37:05,240
Alright.

957
00:37:05,400 --> 00:37:06,000
Get ready.

958
00:37:06,110 --> 00:37:07,960
One, two, three. Smile!

959
00:37:08,710 --> 00:37:09,190
Great.

960
00:37:09,210 --> 00:37:10,070
One more photo.

961
00:37:10,440 --> 00:37:11,040
Here we go!

962
00:37:11,100 --> 00:37:11,940
Is everyone smiling? Good.

963
00:37:11,940 --> 00:37:12,600
Yes, we are.

964
00:37:12,840 --> 00:37:13,550
One more.

965
00:37:13,550 --> 00:37:14,210
Let's do it.

966
00:37:15,190 --> 00:37:16,590
One, two, three.

967
00:37:26,880 --> 00:37:28,810
The People's Court of Nanyu County

968
00:37:28,840 --> 00:37:30,070
is now hearing in public

969
00:37:30,070 --> 00:37:32,670
the case prosecuted by Nanyu County
People's Procuratorate

970
00:37:32,670 --> 00:37:35,070
against Hong Zhansheng

971
00:37:35,710 --> 00:37:36,440
and Li Xiang

972
00:37:36,670 --> 00:37:39,510
for harboring and leaking
important state secrets.

973
00:37:39,510 --> 00:37:40,840
Court is now in session.

974
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:41,840
First,

975
00:37:42,190 --> 00:37:43,250
the clerk will read

976
00:37:43,360 --> 00:37:44,560
the courtroom rules.

977
00:37:46,670 --> 00:37:48,870
The courtroom rules are now announced.

978
00:37:48,960 --> 00:37:49,440
First,

979
00:37:49,640 --> 00:37:50,950
all personnel must obey

980
00:37:50,950 --> 00:37:52,400
the presiding judge's commands.

981
00:37:52,400 --> 00:37:53,000
Second...

982
00:37:53,150 --> 00:37:54,280
Where is Yu Gaoyuan?

983
00:37:55,330 --> 00:37:56,440
Something came up at his home again.

984
00:37:56,440 --> 00:37:57,970
He rushed off to make a call.

985
00:37:59,680 --> 00:38:03,140
[China Post]

986
00:37:59,770 --> 00:38:01,890
Gaoyuan, they still took

987
00:38:01,920 --> 00:38:03,070
our family's land.

988
00:38:03,620 --> 00:38:05,420
What gave them the right to do so?

989
00:38:05,510 --> 00:38:07,190
All villagers must follow the policy.

990
00:38:07,190 --> 00:38:08,190
That's only fair.

991
00:38:33,230 --> 00:38:34,430
As the ancients said,

992
00:38:34,630 --> 00:38:35,150
"the law

993
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:37,200
is the scale of the state,

994
00:38:37,320 --> 00:38:38,920
and the ethical benchmark for a society—

995
00:38:38,920 --> 00:38:41,580
a vital instrument
for governing the country."

996
00:38:43,630 --> 00:38:44,280
Being born

997
00:38:44,280 --> 00:38:46,140
into this great era, we certainly

998
00:38:46,280 --> 00:38:46,800
have to take

999
00:38:46,800 --> 00:38:48,960
advancing the rule of law
as our responsibility.

1000
00:38:48,960 --> 00:38:50,360
This is a duty and mission

1001
00:38:50,670 --> 00:38:51,610
that we cannot avoid,

1002
00:38:51,610 --> 00:38:53,410
nor do we have the right to avoid.

1003
00:38:55,030 --> 00:38:55,480
Third,

1004
00:38:55,760 --> 00:38:58,110
any remarks shall be made only with
permission of the presiding judge.

1005
00:38:58,110 --> 00:38:58,570
Fourth,

1006
00:38:58,760 --> 00:39:00,280
without court permission,

1007
00:39:00,280 --> 00:39:02,440
no audio or video recording,
or photographs

1008
00:39:02,440 --> 00:39:03,170
are allowed.

1009
00:39:03,590 --> 00:39:04,150
Fifth,

1010
00:39:04,360 --> 00:39:06,960
spectators cannot speak, ask questions,

1011
00:39:07,320 --> 00:39:07,920
or...

1012
00:39:08,160 --> 00:39:10,080
Is this a bad omen or a good one?

1013
00:39:10,110 --> 00:39:10,920
No smoking.

1014
00:39:11,150 --> 00:39:12,510
No spitting.

1015
00:39:13,590 --> 00:39:15,190
This concludes the reading.

1016
00:39:16,590 --> 00:39:17,790
The trial starts now.

1017
00:39:18,150 --> 00:39:19,550
Bring in the defendants.

1018
00:39:51,760 --> 00:39:53,020
Prosecutor, proceed.

1019
00:39:53,190 --> 00:39:54,440
The defendant, Li Xiang,

1020
00:39:54,440 --> 00:39:56,230
blatantly pleaded not guilty
for a criminal

1021
00:39:56,230 --> 00:39:58,230
regardless of clearly established

1022
00:39:58,230 --> 00:40:00,690
facts and conclusive evidence
of the offense.

1023
00:40:00,690 --> 00:40:02,760
His intention was to confuse the public,

1024
00:40:02,760 --> 00:40:03,880
exonerate the criminal,

1025
00:40:03,880 --> 00:40:06,110
and cover up for the latter's
acts of crime.

1026
00:40:06,110 --> 00:40:06,760
To add to that,

1027
00:40:06,760 --> 00:40:07,510
the defendant, Li Xiang,

1028
00:40:07,510 --> 00:40:08,880
before the case went to trial,

1029
00:40:08,880 --> 00:40:10,030
disclosed to the criminal

1030
00:40:10,030 --> 00:40:12,280
the content
of the prosecution's indictment,

1031
00:40:12,280 --> 00:40:13,480
together with the prosecution's

1032
00:40:13,480 --> 00:40:14,630
sentencing submission.

1033
00:40:14,630 --> 00:40:15,550
This behavior constitutes

1034
00:40:15,550 --> 00:40:18,150
the crime of leaking
important state secrets.

1035
00:40:18,410 --> 00:40:19,360
The defendant carried out

1036
00:40:19,360 --> 00:40:21,400
such actions
under the instruction of the other

1037
00:40:21,400 --> 00:40:22,760
defendant, Hong Zhansheng.

1038
00:40:22,760 --> 00:40:24,480
Therefore, defendant Hong Zhansheng

1039
00:40:24,480 --> 00:40:26,810
also committed the two crimes mentioned.

1040
00:40:27,110 --> 00:40:28,230
The actions of these two defendants

1041
00:40:28,230 --> 00:40:29,360
objectively contributed to

1042
00:40:29,360 --> 00:40:30,240
the serious consequences of

1043
00:40:30,240 --> 00:40:31,590
exonerating the criminal and causing

1044
00:40:31,590 --> 00:40:32,390
social chaos.

1045
00:40:33,070 --> 00:40:34,590
Besides, after their arrest,
the two defendants

1046
00:40:34,590 --> 00:40:35,510
firmly denied all charges

1047
00:40:35,510 --> 00:40:36,910
with a hostile attitude.

1048
00:40:36,920 --> 00:40:39,250
There are no circumstances for leniency.

1049
00:40:40,280 --> 00:40:41,590
Our first piece of evidence

1050
00:40:41,590 --> 00:40:43,070
is the representation agreement received

1051
00:40:43,070 --> 00:40:44,320
by the defendant, Li Xiang,

1052
00:40:44,320 --> 00:40:45,250
proving him to be

1053
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:46,070
the defense lawyer

1054
00:40:46,070 --> 00:40:48,470
for the convicted offender Qiao Zhiliang.

1055
00:40:48,670 --> 00:40:50,600
Defense counsel, any objections?

1056
00:40:51,030 --> 00:40:51,920
No objections.

1057
00:40:53,960 --> 00:40:55,400
Our second piece of evidence

1058
00:40:55,400 --> 00:40:56,400
is the defense statement

1059
00:40:56,400 --> 00:40:57,550
made by the defendant, Li Xiang,

1060
00:40:57,550 --> 00:40:58,950
in Qiao Zhiliang's case.

1061
00:40:58,960 --> 00:41:00,220
The matter to be proved

1062
00:41:00,360 --> 00:41:01,430
is that the defendant, Li Xiang,

1063
00:41:01,430 --> 00:41:02,960
disregarded the large number of facts

1064
00:41:02,960 --> 00:41:04,150
presented by the prosecution

1065
00:41:04,150 --> 00:41:05,070
regarding Qiao's criminal acts,

1066
00:41:05,070 --> 00:41:07,330
and blatantly argued not guilty for him.

1067
00:41:10,670 --> 00:41:12,590
Defense counsel, any objections?

1068
00:41:12,590 --> 00:41:13,450
No objections.

1069
00:41:14,840 --> 00:41:16,150
Our third piece of evidence

1070
00:41:16,150 --> 00:41:18,280
is the testimony of the police officer
on duty at the detention center.

1071
00:41:18,280 --> 00:41:19,590
The matter to be proved is

1072
00:41:19,590 --> 00:41:21,380
that during a meeting
with the convicted offender,

1073
00:41:21,380 --> 00:41:22,630
Qiao Zhiliang,
the defendant, Li Xiang,

1074
00:41:22,630 --> 00:41:24,590
leaked the case details
without authorization

1075
00:41:24,590 --> 00:41:25,800
and told the former

1076
00:41:25,820 --> 00:41:28,030
that the prosecution
would suggest a death sentence.

1077
00:41:28,030 --> 00:41:29,480
Defense counsel, any objections?

1078
00:41:29,480 --> 00:41:30,340
No objections.

1079
00:41:36,070 --> 00:41:37,400
All the evidence is solid.

1080
00:41:37,400 --> 00:41:38,630
Defense counsel,

1081
00:41:39,030 --> 00:41:40,920
would you present any evidence

1082
00:41:41,510 --> 00:41:42,480
to the court?

1083
00:41:42,670 --> 00:41:43,190
Yes.

1084
00:41:45,110 --> 00:41:46,510
Exhibit 1 of our evidence

1085
00:41:46,840 --> 00:41:48,640
is the prosecution's Exhibit 1,

1086
00:41:49,070 --> 00:41:50,360
proving that my client

1087
00:41:50,670 --> 00:41:52,880
accepted Qiao Zhiliang's request
for representation

1088
00:41:52,880 --> 00:41:55,210
and acted as the latter's defense lawyer.

1089
00:41:55,280 --> 00:41:57,030
Prosecutor, any objections?

1090
00:41:57,770 --> 00:41:58,630
No objections.

1091
00:41:59,480 --> 00:42:00,070
Go ahead.

1092
00:42:00,480 --> 00:42:01,880
Exhibit 2 of our evidence

1093
00:42:02,480 --> 00:42:04,280
is the prosecution's Exhibit 2.

1094
00:42:04,440 --> 00:42:05,920
The matter to be proved

1095
00:42:06,070 --> 00:42:07,000
is that my client

1096
00:42:07,190 --> 00:42:08,440
faithfully fulfilled

1097
00:42:08,440 --> 00:42:09,550
his lawful duties

1098
00:42:09,670 --> 00:42:11,550
as a defense lawyer

1099
00:42:12,390 --> 00:42:13,960
and defended his client to the best

1100
00:42:13,960 --> 00:42:14,820
of his ability.

1101
00:42:16,460 --> 00:42:17,190
Prosecutor.

1102
00:42:17,770 --> 00:42:19,190
No objections to the evidence.

1103
00:42:19,190 --> 00:42:21,590
But we object to the defender's statement.

1104
00:42:21,630 --> 00:42:22,320
Defender.

1105
00:42:22,630 --> 00:42:24,030
Exhibit 3 of our evidence

1106
00:42:24,710 --> 00:42:26,510
is the prosecution's Exhibit 3,

1107
00:42:27,020 --> 00:42:28,500
proving that my client

1108
00:42:28,590 --> 00:42:29,630
fulfilled his lawful duties

1109
00:42:29,630 --> 00:42:30,840
while performing

1110
00:42:31,110 --> 00:42:33,070
his obligation to meet his client.

1111
00:42:33,630 --> 00:42:34,360
Prosecutor.

1112
00:42:34,480 --> 00:42:35,800
No objections to the evidence.

1113
00:42:35,800 --> 00:42:38,030
But we object to the defender's statement.

1114
00:42:38,030 --> 00:42:38,630
Defender.

1115
00:42:39,070 --> 00:42:40,470
Exhibit 4 of our evidence

1116
00:42:41,030 --> 00:42:42,880
is the interrogation transcript

1117
00:42:42,880 --> 00:42:43,940
when Qiao Zhiliang

1118
00:42:43,960 --> 00:42:45,550
was interviewed

1119
00:42:45,840 --> 00:42:46,970
by the prosecution.

1120
00:42:49,960 --> 00:42:50,710
Prosecutor.

1121
00:42:55,800 --> 00:42:56,550
Prosecutor!

1122
00:42:58,420 --> 00:42:59,510
N-No objections.
